# Dashboard Rules

## L0 pages
- Summary cards, progress charts, risk tables, leadership asks
- No ticket-level or engineer-level detail

## L1 pages
- Detailed weekly track updates in tables
- Group by initiative where possible

## Status values
`GREEN` | `AMBER` | `RED` | `BLUE` | `GREY`

## Confidence values
`HIGH` | `MEDIUM` | `LOW`

## Progress
Numeric 0–100 only

## Leadership asks
Must display owner and due date when available

## Empty states
Every list/table needs an empty state message

## Colors
- Green → on track
- Amber → at risk
- Red → blocked
- Blue → complete
- Grey → not started
